Z||000016||fierohoho||07-25-2001||08:35 PM||||I must confess, we in the small town of Mora do not have a donut shop.<P>The closest shop is about 1 hour/55 miles away.<P>I have found a Fiero, while it gets good mileage, can only hold about two days worth of donuts so the cost per donut goes up considerably when its time to make a run.<P>Please donate what you can to keep a small town cop happy. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Look forward to your E My7Fieros.<P>------------------<BR>'84 SE 2.5l<BR>'85 Coupe 2.5l now getting a 3800<BR>'86 SE 2.5l||||reg||1
