Z||000018||fierohoho||07-26-2001||09:48 AM||||The line was used in two movies, the first one was:<P>"The Treasure of the Sierra Madre" made in 1948 and starring Humphrey Bogart.<P>The line was said by the character Gold Hat played by Alfonso Bedoya. <P><BR>His character said, "Badges? We ain't got no badges.We don't need no badges.I don't have to show you any stinking badges."<P>The second movie was: <P>"Blazing Saddles" made in 1974 starring too many people to list.<P>A mexican said, "Badges? We don't need no stinking badges!"<P>Just setting the record straight. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>'84 SE 2.5l<BR>'85 Coupe 2.5l now getting a 3800<BR>'86 SE 2.5l||||reg||1
